o.jpg"},{"id":37145,"name":"Henri Guégan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3dyEWcjHcB1S0XtWuKKGMoftYiT.jpg"},{"id":54379,"name":"Rudy Lenoir","role":"Invité / Gardien-chef","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q0cyYe4WQnW4pMhcBpxWBRX9HoC.jpg"},{"id":2310829,"name":"Jacques de Lanoye"},{"id":54383,"name":"Jean Minisini","role":"Homme de main de Fantômas"},{"id":25976,"name":"Bernard Musson","role":"Agent qui arrête le commissaire Juve","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zbgaGfQbcIi7iUy3PhIBa0WB2kY.jpg"},{"id":13697,"name":"Dominique Zardi","role":"Homme de main de Fantômas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/go1b6s9ZOwbBRUfWZztrJsxOcPF.jpg"},{"id":251203,"name":"Yvan Chiffre","role":"Homme de main de Fantômas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lkM5LpYBxYVVUVZVmW0W6ppry5j.jpg"},{"id":24478,"name":"Raymond Pellegrin","role":"Fantômas (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x23CJEd32WpIzYdh7Sq1NodVXbe.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Fantomas 70","overview":"Fantomas compie clamorosi furti nascondendosi sotto le sembianze del giornalista Fandor, che finisce in galera. L'ispettore Juve, che ha subito la stessa beffa, lo aiuta ed entrambi riescono a rintracciare il bandito. L'inafferrabile fuggirà però per vie acquatiche.","tagline":"Gli uomini lo cacciano - Le donne lo cercano! Super-Ladro ... Maestro amante ... Sta per saccheggiare il mondo!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Fantomas","overview":"Fantômas is a man of many disguises. He uses maquillage as a weapon. He can impersonate anyone using an array of masks and can create endless confusion by constantly changing his appearance."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Un personnage mystérieux commet des vols et des crimes dans la capitale sous le nom de Fantômas. Le commissaire Juve et le journaliste Fandor enquêtent chacun a leur manière sur cette affaire. Ils ne croient pas à l’existence d’un tel malfaiteur. Mais ils se retrouvent confrontés à Fantômas, dont la méthode consiste à utiliser des masques pour commettre ses méfaits. Il prend ainsi diverses identités dont celles de nos deux héros.","tagline":"Fantômas, l’ennemi public n°1 de vos soucis quotidiens."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tL1zQjScVe5u4O7o4FCBdpzDxBX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pXYTP26ED7gAyyQ5QNrsGeieYbY.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1871,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tL1zQjScVe5u4O7o4FCBdpzDxBX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tL1zQjScVe5u4O7o4FCBdpzDxBX.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tL1zQjScVe5u4O7o4FCBdpzDxBX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tL1zQjScVe5u4O7o4FCBdpzDxBX.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uZt3Spr0dQwAtkglxu5Ne7RvAJd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uZt3Spr0dQwAtkglxu5Ne7RvAJd.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eBg2ka0vAHZEwIWAaIYcDVp0wPx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eBg2ka0vAHZEwIWAaIYcDVp0wPx.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eBg2ka0vAHZEwIWAaIYcDVp0wPx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eBg2ka0vAHZEwIWAaIYcDVp0wPx.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bZd7mSdJQENp8WpanJpriWno8EZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bZd7mSd